("The cockpits hide the cables completely, and the Evo TLO and TLO Stem can be ordered with internal cable ports. The added weight is around 4g.", "コックピットはケーブルを完全に隠し、エボTLOとTLOステムも内装ケーブル穴を選べます。増える重量は約4gです。"),
("Approved up to 110kg", "最大110kgまで承認"),
